      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Compute $\\text{E}[{p}^{2}q],$ where $p$ and $q$ are constants.",
      "worked_solution": "For any constant $a,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[a]=a.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{p}^{2}q]={p}^{2}q.\n$$",
