    "q-109232": {
      "dom_id": "step-q109232",
      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "Compute $\\text{E}[5X-7]$ if $\\text{E}[X]=-2.$",
      "worked_solution": "For any constants $a$ and $b$ and any random variable $X,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[aX+b]=a\\text{E}[X]+b.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[5X-7] & =5\\text{E}[X]-7 \\\\  & =5(-2)-7 \\\\  & =-17.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
